    "title": "docs: fix outdated links and formatting in README",
    "body": "## Summary\n\nFixes outdated links and formatting issues in the README documentation.\n\n## Changes\n\n1. **Fix broken link in `docs/lints/README.md`**: The relative link `../roadmap_mvp.md` pointed to `docs/roadmap_mvp.md` (which doesn't exist). Fixed to `../../roadmap_mvp.md` to correctly point to the root-level file.\n\n2. **Fix missing closing code block in README.md**: The `budget.toml` configuration example's toml code block was missing its closing ````, causing the subsequent \"Inline diagnostics\" paragraph to render inside the code block.\n\n3. **Fix lint count in README.md**: Updated \"Eight lints ship in v0.1.1\" to \"Nine lints\" to match the actual 9 lints listed in the Features section.\n\n## Verification\n\n- All external links verified as valid (HTTP 200)\n- All relative links verified as pointing to existing files\n- Code reviewer confirmed changes are correct\n\nCloses #210",
